{"video":"IEgEv00bNsw","lines":[{"t":[0,1.5],"en":"Mail's here."},{"t":[1.5,3.5],"en":"Oh! Hey."},{"t":[3.5,7.5],"en":"Jerry, you got soup all over our mail, you jerk."},{"t":[7.5,10.5],"en":"Oh, my God, it's an envelope from the IOW Awards office."},{"t":[10.5,12.5],"en":"Nobody freak out."},{"t":[12.5,15],"en":"Do you know what this means?"},{"t":[15,17.5],"en":"I am Pawnee's Woman of the Year."},{"t":[17.5,20.5],"en":"The IOW is the Indiana Organization of Women."},{"t":[20.5,23.5],"en":"I have been a dues-paying member since I was nine,"},{"t":[23.5,25.5],"en":"and every year they choose one woman"},{"t":[25.5,28.5],"en":"to win the Dorothy Everton Smythe Female Empowerment Award."},{"t":[28.5,30.5],"en":"Winning is every girl's dream."},{"t":[30.5,32.5],"en":"But it's my destiny."},{"t":[32.5,34],"en":"And my dream."},{"t":[34,35],"en":"Can you read it, please?"},{"t":[35,38],"en":"Where are my ladies at?"},{"t":[38,40],"en":"Here we go."},{"t":[40,42],"en":"The IOW is proud to announce"},{"t":[42,44],"en":"this year's Dorothy Everton Smythe"},{"t":[44,46],"en":"Female Empowerment Award winner,"},{"t":[46,48],"en":"Ronald Swanson."},{"t":[48,49],"en":"Ah-ha, okay, pretty funny."},{"t":[49,50],"en":"Says Ronald Swanson."},{"t":[50,52],"en":"What? No, no, no it does."},{"t":[52,54],"en":"I... that... no."},{"t":[54,56],"en":"That... what?"},{"t":[56,57],"en":"They only honor women,"},{"t":[57,58.5],"en":"and Ron's the opposite of a woman."},{"t":[58.5,59.5],"en":"What's going on?"},{"t":[59.5,61.5],"en":"You're, um, Pawnee's Woman of the Year,"},{"t":[61.5,62.5],"en":"looks like."},{"t":[65.5,66.5],"en":"Well, it's about time."},{"t":[66.5,68.5],"en":"No, no, no."},{"t":[68.5,70.5],"en":"They've obviously made some sort of mistake."},{"t":[70.5,71.5],"en":"Bully for me!"},{"t":[71.5,72.5],"en":"Congratulations, Ron."},{"t":[72.5,73.5],"en":"Congratulations."},{"t":[73.5,74.5],"en":"It's very exciting."},{"t":[74.5,75.5],"en":"Awesome."},{"t":[75.5,77.5],"en":"Awards are stupid,"},{"t":[77.5,80.5],"en":"which is why I fully intend to decline this nonsense"},{"t":[80.5,83],"en":"and recommend it go to Leslie,"},{"t":[83,87],"en":"because she works really hard and I don't."},{"t":[87,89],"en":"However,"},{"t":[89,92],"en":"she cares way too much about crap like this,"},{"t":[92,95],"en":"which is why I can't pass up this opportunity"},{"t":[95,97],"en":"to tease her about it."},{"t":[97,99],"en":"Well, we can't stand around all day"},{"t":[99,101.5],"en":"congratulating me on receiving an award"},{"t":[101.5,104],"en":"from some lousy women's organization."},{"t":[104,105.5],"en":"Back to work, everyone."},{"t":[113.5,114.5],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[114.5,115.5],"en":"What's in the envelope?"},{"t":[115.5,116.5],"en":"Nothing."},{"t":[117.5,118.5],"en":"You wanted to see me?"},{"t":[118.5,120.5],"en":"I think the Pawnee chapter of the IOW"},{"t":[120.5,121.5],"en":"has made a little mistake."},{"t":[123.5,124.5],"en":"Really?"},{"t":[124.5,127.5],"en":"You're saying a women's organization made a mistake?"},{"t":[127.5,129],"en":"I was as surprised as you were."},{"t":[129,130],"en":"But the fact is,"},{"t":[130,132],"en":"they only give that award to women."},{"t":[132,133],"en":"Hmm."},{"t":[133,136],"en":"Well, it definitely said Ron Swanson in the letter."},{"t":[136,138],"en":"Yeah, but it also mentioned my camp project."},{"t":[138,139],"en":"Ah, yes."},{"t":[139,140],"en":"Camp Zena."},{"t":[140,140.5],"en":"Athena."},{"t":[140.5,141.5],"en":"Camp Athena."},{"t":[141.5,142.5],"en":"You don't even know the name."},{"t":[142.5,143.5],"en":"Oh, I almost got it."},{"t":[143.5,144.5],"en":"I was pretty close."},{"t":[144.5,145],"en":"No."},{"t":[145,146],"en":"Look, Leslie,"},{"t":[146,147],"en":"your job,"},{"t":[147,148.5],"en":"which you're great at,"},{"t":[148.5,150],"en":"is making me look good,"},{"t":[150,152],"en":"which you've clearly done well"},{"t":[152,154],"en":"because I'm getting an award."},{"t":[154,155],"en":"Right?"},{"t":[156,157],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[157,158.5],"en":"Be proud of yourself."},{"t":[158.5,159.5],"en":"I mean, you deserve an award."},{"t":[159.5,161.5],"en":"Not this one, obviously."},{"t":[161.5,162.5],"en":"This one belongs to me."},{"t":[162.5,163.5],"en":"But some other one."},{"t":[163.5,165.5],"en":"Some other lesser award."},{"t":[165.5,167.5],"en":"And if the shoe were on the other foot"},{"t":[167.5,168.5],"en":"and you won the award,"},{"t":[168.5,170.5],"en":"I would have congratulated you."},{"t":[173.5,174.5],"en":"Congratulations, Ron."},{"t":[174.5,175.5],"en":"What's that?"},{"t":[175.5,176.5],"en":"You heard me."},{"t":[178.5,179.5],"en":"You promised the girls a field"},{"t":[179.5,181.5],"en":"by the end of this week."},{"t":[181.5,183.5],"en":"Well, it's a man's world, Winston."},{"t":[183.5,184.5],"en":"Get used to it."},{"t":[184.5,186.5],"en":"I'm a man."},{"t":[186.5,189],"en":"You know who you should talk to?"},{"t":[189,190],"en":"Ron Swanson."},{"t":[190,192],"en":"He's an award-winning public servant."},{"t":[192,194],"en":"He's the guy that's going to help you out."},{"t":[194,195],"en":"Go on in there."},{"t":[195,196],"en":"Excuse me."},{"t":[196,198],"en":"Ron, someone's coming in."},{"t":[198,199],"en":"Hi."},{"t":[199,201],"en":"Leslie said I should come over here."},{"t":[201,203],"en":"If you don't get credit for your work,"},{"t":[203,205],"en":"why bother doing it?"},{"t":[205,207],"en":"Because I love it."},{"t":[207,208.5],"en":"But I'm going to make a point."},{"t":[208.5,209.5],"en":"I love it."},{"t":[209.5,210.5],"en":"But I'm going to make a point."},{"t":[213.5,214.5],"en":"But I'm going to make a point."},{"t":[214.5,215.5],"en":"I love it."},{"t":[215.5,216.5],"en":"I love it."},{"t":[216.5,217.5],"en":"But I'm going to make a point."},{"t":[220.5,221.5],"en":"But I'm going to make a point."}]}
